ANCIENT.ZIP

Set of 9 overlays for Steve Litchfields Mapper3a elsewhere on this forum.
The overlays and pic file should be placed in the app/mapper3a/ directory.
The monuments in these overlays are open to the public or might be viewed from the road.
(Haven't visited them all so beware of surprises !)
Some of them are on farm land. Act like a guest when you're accessing private grounds.
Some (less spectaculair) monuments are sometimes hard to find, you will need a good map and 
sometimes even a compass !

						Have fun !
						Maarten Kroes
						The Netherlands.
 
